<div class="static-page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <h1><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text me-2"></i>Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-content">
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>1. General</h3>
        <p>By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>2. Accounts</h3>
        <p>To make purchases, you must register for an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities that occur under your account. You must provide accurate and complete information.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>3. Products & Pricing</h3>
        <p>All prices are listed in Kenyan Shillings (KES) and include applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. We reserve the right to update prices at any time. Prices at the time of order placement will apply to your purchase.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>4. Orders & Payment</h3>
        <p>By placing an order, you agree to pay the total amount displayed at checkout, including product costs, shipping fees, and taxes. Payment is processed securely through Stripe. Orders are confirmed only upon successful payment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>5. Shipping & Delivery</h3>
        <p>We aim to deliver orders within the estimated timeframes. Delivery times may vary based on your location and the selected shipping method. See our <%= link_to "Shipping Info", shipping_info_path, style: "color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;" %> page for more details.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>6. Returns & Refunds</h3>
        <p>Returns are accepted within 14 days of receipt. Items must be in their original condition. For full details, please see our <%= link_to "Return Policy", return_policy_path, style: "color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;" %>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>7. Intellectual Property</h3>
        <p>All content on this website, including text, images, logos, and designs, is our property or used with permission. You may not reproduce or distribute any content without written consent.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>8. Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p>We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our services. Our liability is limited to the amount paid for the specific product or service in question.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>9. Contact</h3>
        <p>For questions about these Terms, please <%= link_to "contact us", new_contact_message_path, style: "color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;" %>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render "pages/shared_styles" %>
